 gner\, known as Ms. Messy\, leads Thursday classes from 2:00 PM to 3:00 P
 M. Term 1 runs August 27 through October 15 and costs $96 for museum memb
 ers or $110 for non-members\, with Term 2 following October 22 through De
 cember 17. The term ends with an artwork showcase for family.\nPrice: not
  published by the venue\, so confirm before you go\nArea: Pensacola\nTime
 s: Thursday 8/27 · 2:00 PM to 3:00 PM\nhttps://coastaleventures.com/even
